@host = http://localhost:5090

### Easy → LM Studio
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "model": "auto", "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "hello, how are you today?" } ] }

### Hard → Claude Code CLI
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "model": "auto", "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "Compare the trade-offs between event sourcing and CRUD for a billing system." } ] }

### Streaming
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "model": "auto", "stream": true, "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "why does this async code deadlock when I call .Result?" } ] }

### Force a backend
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "model": "claude", "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "Reply with exactly one word: pong" } ] }

### Explain a decision without calling a model
POST {{host}}/semantic-router/classify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "prompt": "design a scalable architecture for a multi-tenant platform" }

### Models, and whether Claude is cooling down after a usage limit
GET {{host}}/v1/models
